# Agent continuity at session start (mandatory)

Do **not** wait for the user to ask. On the **first agent turn of every new chat/session**, and after restart/compaction:

## 1. Continuity verify

DGX:
```bash
bash scripts/verify-agent-continuity.sh --all-repos
```
Surface:
```powershell
.\scripts\verify-agent-continuity.ps1
```

If FAIL → fix missing rules/hooks/files, then re-run until PASS (or report a true blocker).

## 2. ALL memory helpers (Checklist A — no skips)

Full detail: `.cursor/rules/agent-read-first-startup.mdc`. Map: `memory-bank/agent-helpers-mandatory-startup.md`.

| # | Helper | Action |
|---|--------|--------|
| 1 | Continuity verify | Script above |
| 2 | Entry routers | Read `AGENTS.md` → `CLAUDE.md` → `CURSOR.md` |
| 3 | **RepoResident** | Read `.agent/STATE.md` (authority); MAP/DECISIONS when routing |
| 4 | **cursor-memory-bank** | Read `memory-bank/activeContext.md` + `progress.md` |
| 5 | **MindLink** | MCP `mindlink_read_memory` (Core + User Profile) + Read `SESSION.md`, LOG last 5, `SHARED.md`; fallback Read `.brain/` |
| 6 | **SessionMem** | MCP `retrieveMemories`; fallback `memory-bank/sessionmem-seeds.md` |
| 7 | **Cursor rules** | **Read every** alwaysApply `.mdc` in `.cursor/rules/` (DGX: also `~/.cursor/rules/`) — not just the index |
| 8 | **graphify** | `graphify query "<task>"` before Read/Grep/Glob |

**Do not be lazy.** Do not treat “I already know” as a skip.

## 3. Every turn (Checklist B) before repo tools

- SessionMem `retrieveMemories`
- graphify query
- Glob-matched Cursor rules for files you will touch
- Re-read STATE + activeContext + SESSION if area changed / after compaction

## 4. Hooks + companion

- Hooks: `sessionStart` / `workspaceOpen` → `.cursor/hooks/session-continuity.sh` (and `~/.cursor/hooks/` on DGX). Hook status is a hint — still run verify if not done this session.
- `--all-repos` on DGX also ensures companion stack (PersonaPlex `:8998`, WSS `:8455`). Companion UI prefers Surface `:5173` (iframe `:8464`); DGX `:5173` is fallback. Git commits do not start these.

## 5. After DGX `src/` edits

```bash
bash scripts/sync-changes-to-pc.sh --include-src --retry-until-complete
```

SessionMem team sync (`sync-sessionmem-team.sh`) after milestones when memories changed — do not skip if the user said “remember” / continuity / push to Surface.

**Note:** This rule lists **helpers to run**, not a dump of every SessionMem/MindLink fact. Facts stay in those stores; this rule makes loading them mandatory.
